LESSONS LEARNED

amulets all cost the same (no point in price-ID'ing them)
read ?oConfuseMonster right away (no point in waiting)
stalker corpse invisibility is also temporary (at least it was in my case)
hide the luckstone when doing sacfests (to avoid/delay crowning)
"f" is "fire" you idiot; when wielding !oExtHeal for pet, use "F" (fight)
  ...and don't add insult to injury: re-wield weapon (vs. healing a foe)
^levelport vanish when you use them?
when levitating over water, don't swap places with pet (*splash*)
  ...this will anger Anhur
apparently Conf ?oTeleport levelport isn't guaranteed?
  ...at Castle(25), asked for 9, got 15
  ...at 15, asked for 9, got 12
don't drop potions while standing on stairway
  ..."crash"
another "c" to take action on as soon as you see it: pyrolisk
  ...put burnables into BoH
don't use the "wield !oParalysis" trick without =oFA
  ...sniffing the fumes renders *me* helpless
vampires
  ...can drain XL ("The vampire bites!  Goodbye level 14.")
     ...although with MC3 via [oMR, this is really really rare
  ...are undead, and thus +oDeath is useless on them
always ID &'s (could be succubus, even in graveyard mass of M's V's W's)
amethyst is a *soft* violet gem (useful for alchemy)
+oMM and +oDeath aren't going to work on a gray dragon (duh!)
  ...think about dragon type when choosing what to attack with
when reverse-geno for wraith corpses, don't have a carnivorous pet nearby
trappers can swallow pets, and they will die
you can #jump right over pits and some other traps (duh!)
always keep enough Pw in astral for one +oDeath for a rider
Angels have MR 80; high resistance to +oDeath and +oMM


